{"schema":"hsr-dialogue.v1","entryId":"other-interaction-p15862","chapterId":"s3446798e33a0c790","referenceCommit":"74a7b96fba32f00cf495a5c00b0311bd02207aaf","rows":[{"id":"other-interaction-p15862-1ab3912d50c6fa736a9b","entryId":"other-interaction-p15862","chapterId":"s3446798e33a0c790","text":"징징징징… 앞에서 끔찍한 기운이 전해져 오고 있어. 먹물처럼 새까맣고, 살육의 음산한 피비린내가 가득해……","speaker":"전율 벌레","mission":"상호작용 기록","scene":"전율 벌레","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["10911904807164661787"],"speakerHashCandidates":["8686096377148011876"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-interaction-p15862-0e0b07d1140be59b84ab","entryId":"other-interaction-p15862","chapterId":"s3446798e33a0c790","text":"다, 다들, 부디 조심해, 징!","speaker":"전율 벌레","mission":"상호작용 기록","scene":"전율 벌레","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["929137076836497584"],"speakerHashCandidates":["8686096377148011876"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-interaction-p15862-852a46ec3906daf2de30","entryId":"other-interaction-p15862","chapterId":"s3446798e33a0c790","text":"느껴져…. 크렘노스성의 용사들이 문 맞은편의 끔찍한 힘에 저항하며 계속 쓰러졌다가 다시 일어나고 있어……","speaker":"전율 벌레","mission":"상호작용 기록","scene":"전율 벌레","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["2938524321776092037"],"speakerHashCandidates":["8686096377148011876"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-interaction-p15862-08449069597f96d677f6","entryId":"other-interaction-p15862","chapterId":"s3446798e33a0c790","text":"나, 나도 용기를 낼 거야. 주인님의 체면을 떨어뜨릴 수는 없지, 징!","speaker":"전율 벌레","mission":"상호작용 기록","scene":"전율 벌레","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["8694239196609928922"],"speakerHashCandidates":["8686096377148011876"],"speakerUnresolved":false}],"wikiReading":{"schema":"hsr-wiki-reading.v1","missions":[{"id":"interaction-p15862","title":"상호작용 기록","page":"虫鸣秘闻•3.0","officialMissionIds":[]}],"occurrences":[{"id":"other-interaction-p15862-1ab3912d50c6fa736a9b","rowId":"other-interaction-p15862-1ab3912d50c6fa736a9b","missionId":"interaction-p15862","mission":"상호작용 기록","sceneId":"s3446798e33a0c790","scen